---
import DocsLayout from './DocsLayout.astro';
import ResetMigrationOverview from '../components/ResetMigrationOverview.astro';
---

<DocsLayout {...Astro.props}>
  <ResetMigrationOverview comparison="reset">
    <Fragment slot="description">
      <p><code>supabase db reset</code> applies all migrations before loading seed data. <code>supabee db reset</code> sets newer migrations aside, rebuilds the database and loads the seed data, then applies those newer migrations.</p>
      <p>For why this ordering is needed, read <a href="/blog/supabee-db-reset/">How to Run Migrations After Seeding with supabase db reset</a>.</p>
    </Fragment>
  </ResetMigrationOverview>
  <slot />
</DocsLayout>
